[{"ID":2,"Description":"<span>Here, we use an <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">attributePath</span> or a <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">propertyPath</span> to calculate some statistics about employee salaries.</span>","TabTitle":"Numerical statistics","PageNumber":2},{"ID":43,"Description":"<span>The <span style=\"color:#009E60;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold\">distinct()</span> method returns a collection of the different hobbies without duplications.</span>","TabTitle":"Distinct explanations","PageNumber":15},{"ID":40,"Description":"<span>In this HDI, you'll learn how to use the following <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">ORDA</span> <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">methods</span> to <span style=\"color:#6607A5;font-weight:bold\">get statistics on an entity selection</span>:<br/><br/>- Compute the <span style=\"color:#6607A5;font-weight:bold\">sum</span> of values -&gt; entitySelection.<span style=\"color:#009E60;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold\">sum()</span><br/>- Get the <span style=\"color:#6607A5;font-weight:bold\">minimum</span> value -&gt; <span style=\"color:#009E60;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal\">entitySelection</span>.min()</span><br/>- Get the <span style=\"color:#6607A5;font-weight:bold\">maximum</span> value -&gt; entitySelection.<span style=\"color:#009E60;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold\">max()</span><br/>- Compute the <span style=\"color:#6607A5;font-weight:bold\">number of \"not null\" <span style=\"color:#000000;font-weight:normal\">values</span> <span style=\"color:#000000;font-weight:normal\">-&gt;</span> <span style=\"color:#000000;font-weight:normal\">entitySelection.<span style=\"color:#009E60;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold\">count()</span></span></span><br/>- Compute the <span style=\"color:#6607A5;font-weight:bold\">average</span> of values -&gt; <span style=\"color:#009E60;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal\">entitySelection.</span>average()</span><br/>- Get the <span style=\"color:#6607A5;font-weight:bold\">distinct <span style=\"color:#000000;font-weight:normal\">values</span> <span style=\"color:#000000;font-weight:normal\">-&gt;</span> <span style=\"color:#009E60;font-style:italic\"><span style=\"color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal\">entitySelection.</span>distinct()</span></span></span>","TabTitle":"Info","PageNumber":1},{"ID":38,"Description":"Form.selectedEmployees.<span style=\"color:#009E60;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold\">average</span>(\"salary\")","TabTitle":"","PageNumber":14},{"ID":37,"Description":"<span>Form.selectedEmployees.<span style=\"color:#009E60;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold\">count</span>(\"extra.hobby\")<br/>Note that \"extra.hobby\" is a <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">propertyPath</span> (extra is an object attribute)</span>","TabTitle":"","PageNumber":13},{"ID":36,"Description":"Form.selectedEmployees.<span style=\"color:#009E60;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold\">sum</span>(\"salary\")","TabTitle":"","PageNumber":12},{"ID":35,"Description":"Form.selectedEmployees.<span style=\"color:#009E60;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold\">max</span>(\"salary\")","TabTitle":"","PageNumber":11},{"ID":34,"Description":"<span style=\"color:#009E60;font-style:italic\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Form.selectedEmployees</span>.<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">min</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">(\"salary\")<br/><span style=\"font-style:normal\">Note that \"salary\" is an <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">attributePath</span>.</span></span></span>","TabTitle":"","PageNumber":10},{"ID":42,"Description":"Here, we get a list of individual hobbies from the employee list.","TabTitle":"Values statistics","PageNumber":3}]